EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}So {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}you probably know this already,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
but just in case you didn't,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}...?
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}The winter soulfish is here today!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dark as night! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Stays for hours!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Freezes you to the bone!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Wait. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Do I have that wrong...?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Yeah, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}hold on. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Don't panic.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It's coming to me...
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Oh yeah. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The winter soulfish must be
something else.
So, yeah. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Enjoy the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},
OK, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Secondo me, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, lo sai già,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ma per sicurezza io te lo dico
lo stesso.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Oggi è il supplizio d'inverno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oscuro
come la notte! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Durerà per ore!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Ci congelerà fino al midollo!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Aspetta, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}c'è qualcosa che non torna!{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Sì, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}aspetta, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}niente paura!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ce la posso fare...
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ma certo! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Il solstizio d'inverno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Il supplizio d'inverno è un'altra
cosa...
Vabbè, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}chiamalo come vuoi.
Io, per sicurezza, ti auguro buona
giornata, poi decidi tu.

